<title>HUNGARY: RIZIKO H1 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF 42.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>RIZIKO H1 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF 42.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating result		  2.0 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   42.8</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		 42.8</p>
<p>    Net sales			   0.0</p>
<p>    Other revenue		     5.7</p>
<p>    Material expenditures	   0.3</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	  2.4</p>
<p>    Other costs			 5.0</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		0.0</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   44.9 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	   342.4</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure     297.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Riziko Factory Rt is a venture capital company. The company generates revenue from exchange rate gains, interest and dividend, therefore it does not have net sales revenues.</p>
<p>The company does not have any comparative figures as 1997 is its first full year of operation.</p>
<p>The figures are not audited and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
